@codelaw/rules-redux-toolkit

The rules are codelaw's own, written for this pack from the Redux Style
Guide (redux.js.org/style-guide), Priority A ("Essential") and Priority B
("Strongly Recommended"). Each rule's text names the guide section it checks.
No rule is ported from an ESLint plugin, so no rule has a `ported_from:`; no
text or code from the Redux documentation or from Redux Toolkit is included.
